aberg@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="313189" owner_email="shawnn@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="2" project="chromiumos/platform/ec" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec" ref="refs/changes/89/313189/2" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="I9cc133052876c4f81697fa16317ffb95fe424a42" commit="6c8657c01a0908d0182309c1e6e6a1d201ca8d3c" commit_message="mesa: Update to 11.0.2 release  Update Mesa to 11.0.2 release for general bugfixes as well as SKL and BSW goodness.  Deleted epatches (merged upstream): -- 10.6-mapi-Adding-missing-string.h-include.patch -- 10.3-gbm-dlopen-libglapi-so-gbm_create_device-works.patch -- 10.6-mesa-do-not-use-_glapi_new_nop_table-for-DRI-builds.patch -- 10.6-i965-do-not-round-line-width-when-multisampling-or-a.patch -- 10.6-mesa-add-GL_RED-GL_RG-support-for-floating-point-tex.patch -- 10.6-mesa-teximage-use-correct-extension-for-accept-stenc.patch -- 10.6-i965-Momentarily-pretend-to-support-ARB_texture_sten.patch -- 10.6-Revert-i965-Advertise-a-line-width-of-40.0-on-Cherry.patch -- 10.6-i965-gen9-Use-custom-MOCS-entries-set-up-by.patch  Deleted epatches (implemented upstream - platform_null -&gt; platform_surfaceless):  -- 10.3-egl-dri2-implement-platform_null.patch -- 10.3-egl-dri2-try-to-use-render-node-if-available.patch  BUG=chrome-os-partner:44264, chrome-os-partner:36905 TEST=Boot image on Glados, Cyan, Rambi, Lumpy, Samus, x86-Alex, TEST=Falco, and Link. Webgl, FishGL and Weavesilk work without any TEST=rendering issue. http://hexgl.bkcore.com/play and TEST=http://users.tpg.com.au/rubixcom/index.html have no render issues  Change-Id: I9cc133052876c4f81697fa16317ffb95fe424a42 Signed-off-by: James Ausmus &lt;james.ausmus@intel.com&gt; Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/303547 Commit-Ready: Ilja Friedel &lt;ihf@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Ilja Friedel &lt;ihf@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Ilja Friedel &lt;ihf@chrom